  "Smart Transitions": "智慧轉場",
  "Smart Transitions: songs from the same album play gapless, crossfades start where a song's ending actually fades out, and silence at the start and end is skipped. Beat-Matched Crossfades (needs Crossfade on): the next song's tempo is matched and its beats lined up during the fade, then it eases back to normal speed. Harmonic Shuffle: Smart shuffle plays songs in compatible keys and similar tempos next to each other. Songs that haven't been analyzed, or have no steady beat, use normal transitions.": "智慧轉場：同一張專輯的歌曲無縫接續，淡入淡出從歌曲結尾真正開始漸弱的地方開始，並略過開頭和結尾的靜音。節拍對齊淡入淡出（需開啟淡入淡出）：淡入淡出時會配合下一首歌曲的速度並對齊節拍，之後再平順地回到正常速度。和聲隨機播放：智慧隨機播放會把調性相容、速度相近的歌曲排在一起。尚未分析或沒有穩定節拍的歌曲使用一般轉場。",
